      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Noticing an unfamiliar man sitting quietly at a corner table with a notebook, Victoria becomes increasingly suspicious. She quickly calls over waitress Sasha to investigate who the silent visitor is and which server is assigned to his table. Let's listen to their urgent hallway exchange in Russian.",
      "gap": 0.8
